<GameData>

	<!-- MOD TEXT -->
	<LocalizedText>
		<Row	Tag="LOC_MOD_TEXT_SERBIA_CIVILIZATION"
				Language="en_US">
			<Text>
				LEADER: Stefan Uros IV Dušan (Serbia, Byzantium, and Greece)
				[NEWLINE]LEADER AGENDA: Emperor of Serbs and Greeks
				[NEWLINE]-Likes Civilizations in a Golden Age.
				[NEWLINE]-Dislikes Civilizations in a Dark Age.
				[NEWLINE]LEADER TRAIT: Dušan's Code
				[NEWLINE]-All Historic Moments gain an additional +1 Era Score.
				[NEWLINE]-Gain the Alemannic Guard unique Unit.
				[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]LEADER UNIT: Alemannic Guard
				[NEWLINE]-Replaces the Knight.
				[NEWLINE]-Adjacent levied Units gain +5 [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength.
				[NEWLINE]-Cost to levy City-State Units decreases by 10% [ICON_Gold] Gold for every Alemannic Guard during a [ICON_GLORY_GOLDEN_AGE] Golden Age.
				[NEWLINE]- +50% Flanking bonus during a [ICON_GLORY_NORMAL_AGE] Normal Age.
				[NEWLINE]- +1 [ICON_Envoy] Envoy token point per turn for every Alemannic Guard during a [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] Dark Age.
				[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]CIVILIZATION: Serbia
				[NEWLINE]CIVILIZATION TRAIT: Sclaveni
				[NEWLINE]-Civilian Units gain +2 [ICON_Movement] Movement during a [ICON_GLORY_GOLDEN_AGE] Golden Age.
				[NEWLINE]-Cities gain +2 [ICON_Housing] Housing during a [ICON_GLORY_NORMAL_AGE] Normal Age.
				[NEWLINE]-Military or Religious Units gain +5 [ICON_Strength] Combat or [ICON_Religion] Religious Strength during a [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] Dark Age.
				[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]CIVILIZATION UNIT: Gusar
				[NEWLINE]-Replaces the Courser.
				[NEWLINE]-1 [ICON_Range] Range.
				[NEWLINE]-Can ranged attack when embarked.
				[NEWLINE]-Can melee attack on land.
				[NEWLINE]- +3 [ICON_Movement] Movement when embarked.
				[NEWLINE]-Adjacent naval units can Coastal Raid.
				[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]CIVILIZATION IMPROVEMENT: Autocephalous Church
				[NEWLINE]- +1 [ICON_Housing] Housing and [ICON_Faith] Faith.
				[NEWLINE]- +2 Loyalty.
				[NEWLINE]- +2 [ICON_GreatProphet] Great Prophet points per turn.
				[NEWLINE]-Gain standard adjacency for various yields based on adjacent Specialty Districts, this becomes major adjacency with Nationalism.
				[NEWLINE]- +15 HP healing for friendly Religious Units on the tile that has not attacked during the turn.
				[NEWLINE]-A City can only have one Autocephalous Church.
				[NEWLINE]-Tiles with an Autocephalous Church cannot be swapped.
				[NEWLINE]-Cannot be built next to another Autocephalous Church.
			</Text>
		</Row>
	</LocalizedText>

